An attractive Bijo rug, late 19th century;
5ft.7in. x 4ft. 1.79m. x 1.22m. Very slight even wear overall, two very small split kinks repaired and re-piled top end left. İt had been put in the Salisbury (United Kingdom) Auction Center. This is from the village of Bijo in the Aksu district of Azerbaijan. 

